isans and chatty shop keepers and take a traditional souvenir or two.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Agadir","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/M%C3%A9dina_Polizzi_Agadir_3.jpg/1280px-M%C3%A9dina_Polizzi_Agadir_3.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/M%C3%A9dina_Polizzi_Agadir_3.jpg/500px-M%C3%A9dina_Polizzi_Agadir_3.jpg","w":1200,"h":720,"author":"Bisel91","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:M%C3%A9dina_Polizzi_Agadir_3.jpg"}},{"id":"agadir_wv_beach","areaId":"agadir","name":"Beach","category":"beach","tags":["beach","sea","nature","sunset"],"location":{"lat":30.4153,"lng":-9.6059},"visitMinutes":120,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"agadir_wv_beach","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":3,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-22"},"hashtags":["beachagadir","agadir"],"bestLight":"sunset","summary":"The main attraction is the beach, which is very big and not very crowded. The beach is very windy, at least in February.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Agadir","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Widoczek_-_panoramio_-_R.Mendakiewicz.jpg/1280px-Widoczek_-_panoramio_-_R.Mendakiewicz.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Widoczek_-_panoramio_-_R.Mendakiewicz.jpg/500px-Widoczek_-_panoramio_-_R.Mendakiewicz.jpg","w":1200,"h":675,"author":"R.Mendakiewicz","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Widoczek_-_panoramio_-_R.Mendakiewicz.jpg"}},{"id":"agadir_memory_of_agadir_museum","areaId":"agadir","name":"Memory of Agadir Museum","category":"museum","tags":["museums"],"location":{"lat":30.42484,"lng":-9.59799},"visitMinutes":120,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"agadir_memory_of_agadir_museum","tickets":[],"signal